      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Etheria needs justice, but the planet isn't just full of war victims, itâ€™s also full of war villains. Now they have to figure out how to share a future together, whether they like it or not. Meanwhile, the universe is watching.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
